e workload snapshot into one of 5 failure classes deterministically: checks container termination reasons (",["$","pre","code-0",{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":"OOMKilled"}]}],", image-pull reasons, crash-loop reasons), rollout conditions (",["$","pre","code-1",{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":"ProgressDeadlineExceeded"}]}],"), and container restart counts (>=5 triggers crash-loop). Falls back to ",["$","pre","code-2",{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":"unknown"}]}]," when no pattern matches"]}]]}],["$","tr","tr-3",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"evidence.collect"}]}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":["$","pre","code-0",{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":"IncidentTriageGraph.ts"}]}]}],["$","td","td-2",{"children":"Invokes the failure-class-specific evidence plan (see table below), gathering previous-container logs, workload events, and/or timeline data within the incident time window"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-4",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"evidence.normalize"}]}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":["$","pre","code-0",{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":"evidence.ts"}]}]}],["$","td","td-2",{"children":["Redacts sensitive text, deduplicates by ID (first occurrence wins), sorts by ",["$","pre","code-0",{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":"observedAt"}]}]," timestamp, and caps to ",["$","pre","code-1",{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":"maxEvidenceItems"}]}]]}]]}],["$","tr","tr-5",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"synthesize"}]}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":["$","pre","code-0",{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":"report.ts"}]}]}],["$","td","td-2",{"children":"Builds a prompt from the incident summary + failure class + normalized evidence bundle, invokes the model, extracts JSON from the response, validates every likely cause against the evidence ID set, and falls back to deterministic failure-class causes if validation fails"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-6",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"report.finalize"}]}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":["$","pre","code-0",{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":"report.ts"}]}]}],["$","td","td-2",{"children":["Assembles the final ",["$","pre","code-0",{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":"IncidentTriageReport"}]}]," artifact with status (","$L9f",", ","$La0",", or ","$La1","), failure class, trigger payload, likely causes with cited evidence, timeline, next steps, and limitations"]}]]}]]}]]}]
