65:["$","p","p-35",{"children":["Alertmanager webhooks targeting the AI Core route (",["$","pre","code-0",{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":"POST agents/kubernetes-ai-responder/runs"}]}],") automatically create persisted, replayable investigation runs. The webhook payload is normalized into a ",["$","pre","code-1",{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":"KubernetesIncidentTrigger"}]}]," with ",["$","pre","code-2",{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":"source: 'alertmanager'"}]}],", and the investigation proceeds identically to a manual run. Failed webhook-triggered runs can be replayed and inspected through the frontend."]}]
