7c:["$","p","p-50",{"children":["If the entity does not have ",["$","pre","code-0",{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":"backstage.io/kubernetes-id"}]}]," annotation, the backend cannot resolve it to a workload, and the investigation will fail. Either add the annotation to the entity's ",["$","pre","code-1",{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":"catalog-info.yaml"}]}]," or provide explicit workload coordinates."]}]
